{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20329",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 6.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.66,
      "end_seconds": 11.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.33,
      "end_seconds": 20.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, it's an itchy rash all over. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.63,
      "end_seconds": 24.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.61,
      "end_seconds": 33.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Alright, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.19,
      "end_seconds": 66.16,
      "duration_seconds": 14.97,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 38.6, temperature is 36.5 degrees, pressure 115 over 68. And heart rate 84, weight 94 kilos, height 156 centimetres. Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.13,
      "end_seconds": 75.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Actually, uh, about... well, ten days. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.21,
      "end_seconds": 87.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.96,
      "end_seconds": 95.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Only an antihistamine, and it's not much. It's mild, honestly. It's every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.88,
      "end_seconds": 99.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.3,
      "end_seconds": 112.84,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "It usually comes with hives. The hives? That's been since last weekend. As for hives, it's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.62,
      "end_seconds": 121.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Have you had an itchy rash all over before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.91,
      "end_seconds": 132.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.61,
      "end_seconds": 138.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Any wheeze, fainting or trouble breathing at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.01,
      "end_seconds": 145.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Erm, no wheeze, fainting or trouble breathing, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.84,
      "end_seconds": 149.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Right, and throat tightness, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.33,
      "end_seconds": 158.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no throat tightness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.91,
      "end_seconds": 164.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.81,
      "end_seconds": 169.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "No, um, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.25,
      "end_seconds": 174.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.71,
      "end_seconds": 177.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Mm, no, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.37,
      "end_seconds": 182.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.75,
      "end_seconds": 193.85,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "I'm on Seretide inhaler, twice a day. Simvastatin. I take it 20 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.88,
      "end_seconds": 198.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.03,
      "end_seconds": 203.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I've, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.07,
      "end_seconds": 209.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.65,
      "end_seconds": 223.17,
      "duration_seconds": 12.52,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I swim twice a week. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.97,
      "end_seconds": 227.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.53,
      "end_seconds": 230.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.35,
      "end_seconds": 249.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.98,
      "end_seconds": 260.65,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "Ah, um, I've had asthma for five years now. I've had high cholesterol for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.96,
      "end_seconds": 266.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Right, I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.02,
      "end_seconds": 283.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.27,
      "end_seconds": 287.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.08,
      "end_seconds": 310.09,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "There are raised pink welts on the trunk and arms, the lips are a little puffy, and the tongue and throat look normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.41,
      "end_seconds": 323.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.02,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards an allergic reaction, possibly to a recently started medicine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.63,
      "end_seconds": 367.82,
      "duration_seconds": 27.19,
      "text": "I'll start you on chlorphenamine, 4 milligrams, every six hours, for three days. You take it by mouth. That's for allergic rash. Stop the new tablet until we know what caused it and write down every medicine you took in the last week. If your throat tightens, your lips swell further or you get breathless, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.38,
      "end_seconds": 371.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.2,
      "end_seconds": 376.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Let's plan a check in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 379.69,
      "end_seconds": 383.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Come by reception afterwards and I'll fix the appointment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.5,
      "end_seconds": 388.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.97,
      "end_seconds": 394.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Uh, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.32,
      "end_seconds": 397.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}